## Fase 2 — Novos Módulos Backend

### 2.1 Módulo Holiday (REQ-08)

#### [NEW] `backend/src/holiday/holiday.module.ts`
#### [NEW] `backend/src/holiday/holiday.service.ts`
#### [NEW] `backend/src/holiday/holiday.controller.ts`

**Responsabilidades do HolidayService:**
- `listNationalHolidays(year)` — lista de feriados nacionais fixos BR
- `checkIsHoliday(date, cityId)` — verifica se data é feriado (nacional ou municipal)
- `recalculateClassDates(classId, holidayDate)` — empurra datas para frente
- `registerClassHoliday(classId, date, reason)` — professor registra dia não-aula

**Schema adicional necessário:**
```prisma
model ClassHoliday {
  id        String   @id @default(uuid())
  classId   String
  date      DateTime
  reason    String
  active    Boolean  @default(true)
  createdAt DateTime @default(now())
  class     Class    @relation(fields: [classId], references: [id], onDelete: Cascade)
  @@map("class_holidays")
}
```

---

### 2.2 Módulo Reembolso / Despesas de Campo (REQ-10)

#### [NEW] `backend/src/reimbursement/reimbursement.module.ts`
#### [NEW] `backend/src/reimbursement/reimbursement.service.ts`
#### [NEW] `backend/src/reimbursement/reimbursement.controller.ts`

**Schema adicional necessário:**
```prisma
model Reimbursement {
  id            String           @id @default(uuid())
  requestedBy   String           // userId do professor/motorista
  acaoId        String?          // Período de Curso relacionado
  amount        Decimal          @db.Decimal(10, 2)
  description   String
  receiptUrl    String           // MinIO URL da foto do recibo
  status        ExpenseStatus    @default(PENDING)
  approvedBy    String?
  approvedAt    DateTime?
  rejectedAt    DateTime?
  rejectionReason String?
  active        Boolean          @default(true)
  createdAt     DateTime         @default(now())
  updatedAt     DateTime         @updatedAt
  @@map("reimbursements")
}
```

**Upload de foto:** Reutiliza `MinioService` já existente em [students/minio.service.ts](file:///C:/Users/Desktop/Downloads/Sistema_upgrade-main_atual/backend/src/students/minio.service.ts) — gera Presigned URL para upload direto do mobile.

